Third-party assets are NOT covered by this licence. This skill drives the
HyperFrames renderer (Apache-2.0) and its scripts fetch free sound effects from
third-party catalogues whose own licences apply — the pipeline records the
licence of every downloaded file in `audio/sfx-licenses.json` precisely so that
this distinction is never lost. The fonts a project uses are subset from
families installed on the machine that built it; those font licences remain with
their owners and are not redistributed by this repository.
